            "review_text": "LuciC57\nBarcelona, Spain14 contributions\n0\nNegative experience, would avoid\nApr 2017 • Couples\nWe stopped here for a beer late afternoon as the prices seemed reasonable. I have to agree with previous reviews the staff were really unwelcoming (eye-rolling, muttering) and the food looked and smelt mediocre at best but since we were not eating it didn't bother us too much. Half way through our beer the owner approached us to tell us 'I no like you here long time' so we hastily finished our beers and left without a goodbye. It was upsetting and put a little downer on our afternoon. We later went next door to Fami cafe where we felt much more comfortable.\nRead more\nWritten April 10, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
