            "review_text": "TravelingDanimal\nPort McNeill, Canada286 contributions\n0\nGreat, cheap food!\nMar 2016 • Couples\nWe started eating here because it was close by and cheap.\nThe food turned out to be very good and we ate here at least once a day for our first 4 days in Nha Trang.\nThe reason for the 4 point review was because the staff started to make us feel like we weren't wanted. We eventually started eating next door because, even though the food wasn't as good, they made us feel more welcome.\nAltogether we were happy to find this place and we'd recommend it for the food but we were disappointed with hospitality.\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2016",
